{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1000000000000001","type":"group","x":-1680,"y":-160,"width":3360,"height":580,"label":"OLS 主线：模型 → 估计 → 推断 → 解释","color":"4"},
		{"id":"1000000000000002","type":"group","x":-1680,"y":600,"width":3360,"height":560,"label":"可信度门槛：代数事实、识别假设与统计性质","color":"3"},
		{"id":"1000000000000003","type":"group","x":-1680,"y":1360,"width":3360,"height":700,"label":"基准 OLS 不够时：先区分是哪一层出了问题","color":"1"},
		{"id":"1000000000000004","type":"group","x":-1680,"y":2260,"width":3360,"height":650,"label":"扩展方法：分别改变推断、权重、识别、模型或数据结构","color":"6"},
		{"id":"1000000000000005","type":"group","x":1900,"y":-160,"width":820,"height":1840,"label":"课程笔记入口","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000001","type":"text","x":-1680,"y":-600,"width":1040,"height":270,"text":"# OLS Hub\n\n**主问题**：线性回归什么时候可信；不可信时，应该改标准误、改估计权重、改识别来源，还是重写模型？\n\n横向读主线，纵向读问题与扩展。节点中的 Obsidian 链接可进入现有详细笔记。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"2000000000000002","type":"text","x":-420,"y":-600,"width":1020,"height":270,"text":"## 阅读规则\n\n1. 绿色：从研究问题走到回归解释。\n2. 黄色：不同结论依赖什么条件。\n3. 红色：基准 OLS 的五类常见缺口。\n4. 紫色：按缺口选择扩展；不同扩展改变的层次不同。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000003","type":"text","x":820,"y":-600,"width":860,"height":270,"text":"## 四类改变\n\n- **推断**：系数不变，标准误改变\n- **权重**：利用误差结构重新估计\n- **识别**：改用工具变量或矩条件\n- **模型 / 数据结构**：重写变量关系或利用面板信息","color":"3"},
		{"id":"2100000000000001","type":"text","x":-1580,"y":-40,"width":680,"height":320,"text":"## 1. Linear Regression Model\n\n把条件均值写成解释变量与参数的线性组合。\n\n先明确目标：描述、预测还是因果。\n\n[[Linear Regression Model]] · [[Simple Linear Regression]] · [[Multiple Linear Regression]]","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2100000000000002","type":"text","x":-780,"y":-40,"width":680,"height":320,"text":"## 2. OLS Criterion\n\n选择使残差平方和最小的参数。\n\n$$\\hat\\beta=\\arg\\min_b (y-Xb)'(y-Xb)$$\n\nOLS 是估计规则，不自动提供因果解释。\n\n[[OLS]] · [[OLS Basics]]","color":"4"},
		{"id":"2100000000000003","type":"text","x":20,"y":-40,"width":680,"height":320,"text":"## 3. Estimator & Residuals\n\n满列秩时：\n\n$$\\hat\\beta=(X'X)^{-1}X'y$$\n\n随后计算拟合值、残差和协方差。\n\n[[OLS Estimator]] · [[OLS Estimation Steps]] · [[Residual]]","color":"4"},
		{"id":"2100000000000004","type":"text","x":820,"y":-40,"width":760,"height":320,"text":"## 4. Inference & Interpretation\n\n系数、标准误、置信区间和检验共同形成结果。\n\n因果语言依赖识别假设，不由显著性自动产生。\n\n[[Confidence Interval]] · [[t Test]] · [[F-test]] · [[R-squared]]","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2200000000000001","type":"text","x":-1580,"y":710,"width":760,"height":340,"text":"## Assumption Gate\n\n- 可计算：无完全共线性\n- 无偏：零条件均值\n- 一致：大样本外生性与正则条件\n- 常规推断：协方差结构正确\n- BLUE：Gauss–Markov 条件\n\n[[Multicollinearity]] · [[Endogeneity]] · [[Heteroskedasticity]] · [[Autocorrelation]]","color":"3"},
		{"id":"2200000000000002","type":"text","x":-620,"y":710,"width":680,"height":340,"text":"## Normal Equations\n\n一阶条件给出：\n\n$$X'\\hat u=0$$\n\n这是最小二乘的代数事实；它本身不保证无偏或因果。\n\n[[OLS Normal Equations]]","color":"3"},
		{"id":"2200000000000003","type":"text","x":260,"y":710,"width":680,"height":340,"text":"## Unbiasedness & Consistency\n\n无偏：重复抽样平均正确。\n\n一致：样本增大时收敛到真实参数。\n\n内生性通常破坏二者；异方差本身未必破坏一致性。\n\n[[OLS unbiasedness]] · [[OLS consistency]]","color":"3"},
		{"id":"2200000000000004","type":"text","x":1140,"y":710,"width":440,"height":340,"text":"## Gauss–Markov\n\nOLS 在相应条件下是 BLUE。\n\nBLUE 不等于正态、不等于因果，也不等于所有估计量中最好。\n\n[[Gauss-Markov theorem]]","color":"3"},
		{"id":"2300000000000001","type":"text","x":-1580,"y":1480,"width":580,"height":460,"text":"## 异方差\n\n误差方差随观测改变。\n\n**主要伤害**：常规标准误与效率。\n\n**诊断**：[[Heteroscedasticity Diagnosis]] · [[White Test]]\n\n**去向**：White robust，或 WLS / GLS。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2300000000000002","type":"text","x":-940,"y":1480,"width":580,"height":460,"text":"## 自相关\n\n误差跨观测期相关。\n\n**主要伤害**：常规标准误与效率，也可能暴露遗漏动态。\n\n**诊断**：[[Autocorrelation Diagnosis]] · [[Breusch-Godfrey Test]]\n\n**去向**：Newey–West 或显式误差模型。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2300000000000003","type":"text","x":-300,"y":1480,"width":580,"height":460,"text":"## 多重共线性\n\n解释变量高度相关；完全共线性使系数无法唯一估计。\n\n**主要伤害**：方差膨胀与系数不稳定。\n\n**诊断**：[[Variance Inflation Factor Diagnostics]]\n\n**去向**：改善设计；预测时考虑 Ridge。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2300000000000004","type":"text","x":340,"y":1480,"width":580,"height":460,"text":"## 内生性\n\n解释变量与误差相关。\n\n**主要伤害**：OLS 通常有偏且不一致。\n\n**诊断**：先判断机制，再看 [[Endogeneity Diagnosis]]。\n\n**去向**：IV / 2SLS / GMM 或更好的研究设计。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2300000000000005","type":"text","x":980,"y":1480,"width":600,"height":460,"text":"## 模型设定错误\n\n遗漏变量、错误函数形式、结构变化或测量误差。\n\n**诊断**：理论、残差、稳定性与 [[Ramsey RESET Test]]。\n\n**去向**：重写模型；稳健标准误不能修复错误设定。\n\n[[Model Misspecification]]","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2400000000000001","type":"text","x":-1580,"y":2380,"width":480,"height":410,"text":"## Robust Inference\n\n**改变**：协方差矩阵。\n\n**不改变**：OLS 系数与识别来源。\n\n[[White Robust Standard Errors]] · [[Newey-West]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2400000000000002","type":"text","x":-1060,"y":2380,"width":480,"height":410,"text":"## WLS / GLS / FGLS\n\n**改变**：残差权重或协方差度量。\n\n用于误差结构可合理建模时提高效率；不能自动修复内生性。\n\n[[Weighted Least Squares]] · [[Generalized Least Squares]] · [[FGLS]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2400000000000003","type":"text","x":-540,"y":2380,"width":480,"height":410,"text":"## Ridge / Robust Fitting\n\n**改变**：损失函数或加入惩罚。\n\n用于预测稳定性、共线性或异常值抗性；目标不同于传统因果 OLS。\n\n[[Ridge Regression]] · [[Robust Regression]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2400000000000004","type":"text","x":-20,"y":2380,"width":480,"height":410,"text":"## IV / 2SLS / GMM\n\n**改变**：参数的识别来源。\n\n使用工具变量或矩条件替代失败的外生性条件。\n\n[[Instrumental Variable]] · [[2SLS]] · [[GMM]] · [[Hansen J Test]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2400000000000005","type":"text","x":500,"y":2380,"width":480,"height":410,"text":"## Panel: FE / RE\n\n**改变**：利用同一个体的重复观察。\n\nFE 与 RE 的关键差异是不可观测个体效应和解释变量的关系。\n\n[[Panel Data Model]] · [[Fixed Effects Model]] · [[Random Effects Model]] · [[Hausman Test]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2400000000000006","type":"text","x":1020,"y":2380,"width":560,"height":410,"text":"## Respecification\n\n**改变**：变量、函数形式、动态结构、样本或研究设计。\n\n多元回归扩展解释变量集合，但控制变量必须有理论角色。\n\n[[Multiple Linear Regression]] · [[Omitted Variable Bias]] · [[Measurement Error]]","color":"6"},
		{"id":"2500000000000001","type":"text","x":2000,"y":-40,"width":620,"height":480,"text":"## 基础与估计\n\n[[02_Economy/01_Econometrics/01_导论|01_导论]]\n\n[[02_一元线性回归]]\n\n[[03_多元线性回归]]\n\n[[05_多元回归模型的矩阵表达]]\n\n恢复模型、估计量、矩阵表达与推断主线。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2500000000000002","type":"text","x":2000,"y":580,"width":620,"height":480,"text":"## 诊断与修正\n\n[[04_模型设定]]\n\n[[06_多重共线性]]\n\n[[07_异方差]]\n\n[[08_自相关]]\n\n恢复常见失败模式、检验与修正方法。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"2500000000000003","type":"text","x":2000,"y":1200,"width":620,"height":380,"text":"## 识别与数据结构\n\n[[09_联立方程模型(内生性)]]\n\n[[13_面板数据模型]]\n\n恢复内生性、工具变量、联立方程与面板估计。","color":"1"}
	],
